Package: xwayland-satellite
Version: @VERSION@-1+@SUITE@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: omakasui <packages@omakasui.org>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libxcb1, libxcb-cursor0, xwayland
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Supreeeme/xwayland-satellite
Description: Rootless Xwayland integration for Wayland compositors.
 Grants rootless Xwayland support to any Wayland compositor implementing
 xdg_wm_base and viewporter, without the compositor having to implement
 Xwayland handling itself.
